                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Transmittal of Income</hi>
                </p>
                <p>In addition to the repatriation of foreign short-term funds, the companies show a
                    healthy increase in transmittal of foreign earnings. The following seasonally
                    adjusted data are from the over-all balance of payments statistics.</p>
